<p>A user has claimed a location. Details below.</p>
<h3>
  Location
</h3>
<p>
  Name: <%= @location.name %><br />
  Address: <%= @location.address + ", " + @location.city.name + ", " + @location.province.abbr %><br />
</p>
<h3>
  User
</h3>
<p>
  Name: <%= @user.name %><br />
  Username: <%= @user.username if @user.username.present? %><br />
  Email: <%= @user.email %><br />
</p>    
<p>
  To review pending claims, please <%= link_to 'click here', pending_claims_locations_url %>.
</p>